scene corpse_loot
note from bd1_corpse_keep: the host spawns one bandit next to itself, kills it, walks to the corpse and frames it for a loot test
god 1
time 12:00
closeui
require nohostile 3000 allow=Neutral
spawn sid=GeneralNPC_Bandit_Stormtrooper at=player+4 freeze=1 as=npc
kill $npc
wait census npc $npc alive=false timeout=15
wait 3
tp $npc+150
frame $npc
box $npc
bot iact
